{"id":"wb-7-1942","name":"红河哈尼梯田","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"红河哈尼梯田","text":"红河哈尼梯田是在云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州，是哈尼族世代耕作的梯田。其历史可追溯至约1300年前，分布范围跨越元阳、红河、金平、绿春四县，总面积约100万亩，其中核心区域集中于元阳县。2013年3月5日，红河哈尼梯田被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。2013年6月22日，第37届世界遗产大会上，红河哈尼梯田文化景观被列入世界遗产名录，遗产区面积16603公顷。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%B2%B3%E5%93%88%E5%B0%BC%E6%A2%AF%E7%94%B0","revisionId":93284838,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93284838","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e3abda3b0d4a5df1f1029e58.jpg","title":"Terrace_field_yunnan_china_denoised.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Terrace_field_yunnan_china_denoised.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/Terrace_field_yunnan_china_denoised.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Jialiang Gao, www.peace-on-earth.org","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​中国云南省梯田","width":320,"height":207}}